<tr><th scope="row">Assigned team</th><td><p>Dedicated SDR execution; confirm assigned resources.</p><a href="https://memoryblue.com/services/sales/sdr-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official SDR source ↗</a></td><td><p>People and capacity agreed for the campaign. Confirm coverage, management and the work transferred.</p></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Outreach channels</th><td><p>Phone, email and LinkedIn in its SDR programme.</p><a href="https://memoryblue.com/services/sales/sdr-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Published outreach model ↗</a></td><td><p>Calling-led outreach, relevant follow-up, qualification and scheduling. Additional channels belong in the agreed scope.</p></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">People and AI</th><td><p>Human SDRs with technology support and AI-assisted preparation.</p><a href="https://memoryblue.com/services/sales/sdr-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">People and technology ↗</a></td><td><p>AI-assisted account preparation; people conduct live calls, handle objections and qualify the next step.</p></td></tr>
